    <statement><p>An unevenly heated metal plate has temperature <m>T(x,y)</m>
in degrees Celsius at a point <m>(x,y)</m>.  If 
<m>T(2,1) = 104</m>, <m>T_x \, (2,1) = 15</m>,
and <m>T_y \, (2,1) = -14</m>, estimate the temperature
at the point <m>(2.02,0.95)</m>.</p>
<p><m>T(2.02,0.95) \approx</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.  
Please include  in your answer.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>105\ {\rm degC}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
